    "detailed_description": "<strong>Upgraded</strong> is a multiplayer PVP Free to Play game where the player controls android classes with different weapons and unique skills to aid them in combat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966680/extras/51e8684806e415cd9ae0765f1f802a0d.avif?t=1729023394\" width=557 height=537 /></span><br><br>Lobbies are player-hosted and player mantained, you can use the server browserr to connect to other lobbies!<br>Improvement is also the name of the game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2966680/extras/28f4ab2790e8ed2dbc4d4f5a31f9bc7e.avif?t=1729023394\" width=539 height=408 /></span><br><br>Current Classes:<br><br>Scout:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Grapple Hook<br></li><li>Primary: West Conqueror<br></li><li>Secondary: Revolver</li></ul><br>Spectre<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Stealth<br></li><li>Primary: Smg .22<br></li><li>Secondary: Pistol .32</li></ul><br>Raider<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Super Hop<br></li><li>Primary: Shotgun<br></li><li>Secondary: Timed Grenade</li></ul><br>Leveller<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Ace in the Hole<br></li><li>Primary: Pump Action Grenade launcher<br></li><li>Secondary: Remote Detonated RPG</li></ul><br>Juggernaut<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Engine Rush<br></li><li>Primary: Executioner Sword<br></li><li>Secondary: Double-Barrel Shotgun</li></ul><br>Heavy Weapons<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Skill: Shoulder Rockets<br></li><li>Primary: Heavy Machine Gun<br></li><li>Secondary: Artillery Launcher</li></ul>",
